rving and desperate people, so Babur believes he has no choice but to surrender.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rgLjZvoiCbEn81fhjFfEVlo80YV.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvVGhlLUVtcGlyZS0lMjgyMDIxJTI5Lw.1.4","title":"Alliances","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2021-08-27T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Khanzada sees a new side to Shaibani. Meanwhile, Babur is informed about a disagreement between Shaibani and the Shah of Persia, and he makes a plan.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/86XHlnwMpKyNhyOQQiRO64fPt50.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvVGhlLUVtcGlyZS0lMjgyMDIxJTI5Lw.1.5","title":"The Roar of the Lion","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2021-08-27T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Babur and his army are outside Samarkand, waiting for Shaibani Khan to give in. Worried about her brother's safety, Khanzada convinces Shaibani to let her talk to Babur.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uIACfTEdoBAEGdjRlOSvvSRR3XW.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvVGhlLUVtcGlyZS0lMjgyMDIxJTI5Lw.1.6","title":"Requiem","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2021-08-27T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Eighteen years later, Humayun and Kamran, both Babur’s sons, are now all grown up and ready to lead a kingdom. Meanwhile, an old and frail Esan Dawlat makes a startling revelation.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4ilLo2is5l5mGdr1U8o8dtXPbSo.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvVGhlLUVtcGlyZS0lMjgyMDIxJTI5Lw.1.7","title":"Panipat","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2021-08-27T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"The sheer power of Ibrahim Lodhi becomes too much for Babur’s army during the Battle of Panipat. Just as he’s about to surrender, Qasim appears with the key to victory.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nkem12di6aZDGyK0QTnzJMehCea.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5j